{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/6/a56bfe567aec24da391224dc2f10e8cc4ef626dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^2=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />, for how many integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d2eb0424b9b9c7e29f98b925fcf8dbd50c7a60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+i)^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"19\" /> an integer?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3de1b43e53586a0dbe00b8c0ae476313f53c6811.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ \\text{none} \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"355\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d2eb0424b9b9c7e29f98b925fcf8dbd50c7a60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+i)^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"19\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adf1d22e30074af8686a73f389d92cf4eaeba2d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^4+4in^3-6n^2-4in+1 = (n^4-6n^2+1) + (4n^3-4n)i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"456\" height=\"21\" />.  This quantity is an integer if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/a/1da9a0ce6cd3916374011a763f3efd445fa3e661.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4n^3 - 4n = 4n(n+1)(n-1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"262\" height=\"21\" />, that is, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/0/d60de0ff1068aa86a1eefd5570251d29153b04b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\in \\{0, 1, -1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />.  Therefore, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/e/90efb101914cf81a2d654b232089b1e38946762a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\textbf{D})\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"32\" /> such values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>-aopspandy, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d2eb0424b9b9c7e29f98b925fcf8dbd50c7a60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+i)^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"19\" /> to be a real number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/6/a862acd63d0a565db8f2a6ca87c7d7d8784924e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" /> must be a scalar multiple of an eighth root of unity, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d6ddc88bd07b6fc55e6a6c56d7f8fa8145c07b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+i = r\\left(\\cos \\frac{k\\pi}{4} + i \\sin \\frac{k\\pi}{4}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"238\" height=\"45\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3dd0099f4188b524cd54bcdff033361be07b87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> is a real number and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/b/a8b994de8b5681fbc4e1195564876c569c0c4e09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leq k \\leq 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bcf129a96f407e0951000c380bf2e993ac900db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r \\sin \\frac{k\\pi}{4} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/b/b1b2501982d1864cd667518673a33746477552c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin \\frac{k\\pi}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"39\" /> is positive.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/5/0d53011e373975e5ec9e7560dd96b2b49aac50ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\in \\{1, 2, 3\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/f/00fab47c0b9d0ce398d03e57d6720129d53434f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/e/a0e997c0ddf3225b50ab4f37d435023749f01c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{1}{\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{4}} = \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"125\" height=\"45\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/8/5989a9de40036b8f30ac34d60f55a50e317ed5cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\sqrt{2}\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{4} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"140\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/7/6d7ca2373575e2917734b9a3552e88f2eee131ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+i)^4 = (1+i)^4 = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"194\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e44ca2cae6be42148fe1b1fd8b5d55bd6b599bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/3/5938c8378baa46d0168b9fb6338db292ee9a26e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{1}{\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{2}} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"110\" height=\"45\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/3/e934fe231568fa08d353cfbae212b4bada8a1dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\cos\\frac{\\pi}{2} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/a/77ac97b047377a63ceb8683db72cebf8e215823d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+i)^4 = i^4 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"134\" height=\"21\" />.  \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/9/7f96a3de68cfb881f4b3cc002ec222bba93f1e16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/4/0c4f94153f4668248f16869ee8faf88ee62da22a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{1}{\\sin\\frac{3\\pi}{4}} = \\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"131\" height=\"45\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/4/dc482cb0ecacf7447dc0d391ca99e467016d37b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\sqrt{2}\\cos\\frac{3\\pi}{4} = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"163\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/7/a67a64a116be391c41d07b79f0f12a3abee97da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+i)^4 = (-1+i)^4 = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"208\" height=\"21\" />.   \n</p><p>In all these cases, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/d/c0d2eb0424b9b9c7e29f98b925fcf8dbd50c7a60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+i)^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"19\" /> is an integer, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b62433cf2791942ea89580cd88dd5e7460de0fa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1, 0, -1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" /> are the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/e/bee7ab79f625e79659ba1977a61744e9b87777fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\mathbf{D})\\ 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"32\" /> possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>~ jaspersun, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\